Project
Chronicle — diary + calendar PWA. Vanilla JS (ES modules), HTML, CSS. Mobile‑first.

Files
Code
index.html
js/: app.js, calendar.js, diary.js, events.js, gestures.js,
     holidays.js, ical.js, notifications.js, sync.js,
     themes.js, themeEditor.js, undo.js
css/: base.css, ribbon.css, week-view.css, day-card.css,
      expanded-day.css, modals.css, agenda.css, themes.css,
      responsive.css
assets/: icons.svg
Theme System (minimal required context)
data.settings stores: uiTheme, uiThemeCustomVars, customUIThemes, eventThemeOverrides, customEventThemes.

Built‑in UI themes + event themes exist in themes.js.

Always call both applyUITheme(settings) and injectEventThemeCSS(settings) after changes.

Theme editor: presets, UI colours, event themes; HSV picker; live preview; save/update/export.

Core Conventions
Plain ES modules, no build step

State in app.js

Save via saveData() → localStorage

Modals use history API

Event/todo titles stored as HTML

Use esc() when inserting user content

Touch‑first interactions

refreshVisibleWeekCards() for event-strip updates

Holiday data not stored as events

No emojis in UI text

CSS variables everywhere

